      "body": "The larger attribute chips end up scooting the \"Edit\" button far off to the right, eating up half of its display: \r\n\r\n![Attribute Chip Size Issue](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/85491794/156879533-b772363d-2026-4f13-9bcd-8dee1b29d156.png)\r\n\r\nA good solution would be to have the edit button under the attribute chips at all times: we would avoid this issue and maintain uniformity with the rest of the buttons.",
